#: Api/Gql/AriManagerUser.php:125
#: Api/Gql/AriManagerUser.php:143
#: arimanager.i18n.php:8
msgid ""
"Asterisk 12 introduces the Asterisk REST Interface (ARI), a set of RESTful "
"API's for building Asterisk based applications. This module provides the "
"ability to add and remove ARI users."
msgstr ""
"Asterisk 12 引入了 Asterisk REST 介面（ARI），這是一組用於建置 Asterisk 應用程式的 RESTful API。此模組提供新增與移除 ARI 使用者的功能。"

#: Arimanager.class.php:128
#: arimanager.i18n.php:20
msgid ""
"Asterisk 12 introduces the Asterisk REST Interface, a set of RESTful API's "
"for building Asterisk based applications. This will enable the ARI server as "
"long as the HTTP server is enabled as well."
msgstr ""
"Asterisk 12 引入了 Asterisk REST 介面，這是一組用於建置 Asterisk 應用程式的 RESTful API。只要 HTTP 伺服器也啟用，這將啟用 ARI 伺服器。"

